  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-04-07T04:43:03.012Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think it would help with immersion and persistence if players would be able to choose to login at their last specific location, and if possible in the same instance they previously left upon logging into the game. \n\nAn option to continue to homeworld should still be there, just now with the button/option to login to \"Last Location\".\n\nEdit: This would help with rejoining friends if you disconnect or crash, also if you like exploring then you step away for a bit you can continue right where you left off instead of being reset to your home location.",
